{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And he watches over a gdish</b> — Rav Hai of blessed memory said: it is the dome that is over the grave, according to the custom of the land of Ishmael. The nearer interpretation is that it is earth and similar to it, and it has no parallel [elsewhere in Scripture]."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:22.248027507Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}